phi-adapter-sdk (0.26.0-1) trixie; urgency=medium

  * The binary boundary: every public data type is a class behind a d-pointer
    (entities, record, forms, actions, answers, the fourteen requests, HTTP,
    TLS, main-loop options), read and written through exported accessors;
    one pointer wide, deep copies. The wire is unchanged (golden fixtures pass).
