phi-adapter-sdk (0.24.0-1) trixie; urgency=medium

  * RoomClass: what a room is, beside the name the household gave it. A
    fixed catalogue (living room, kitchen, bedroom, bathroom, hallway,
    office, garage, garden, terrace, floor, house, ... and Other), the shape
    Hue's room archetypes and Matter's location tags already have, so an
    adapter that knows sets it. v1::Room carries `roomClass`, the wire
    field is "roomClass" (int), and enum_names knows "RoomClass". Core
    fills a blank from the adapter and never overwrites what the household
    chose; the language packs say a room of a class in every language.

